    "turn_text": "Culver's got a heck of a job, though, ahead of them, because there's multiple, obviously, issues they talk about. Hunter Biden's laptop constantly. Is that a real issue, or should we move on to? We'll see. We'll see. It's just a matter of how much energy they can put into that. There's only so many things they can do, that's for sure. The Fair Tax Act that people talk about would eliminate the IRS and set up a national sales tax to replace that revenue. Is that crazy talk, or is that really a possible thing?",
