      },
      {
        "text": "Reconciliation allows passage of legislation with only party support, bypassing the filibuster.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Passage of major legislation requires 60 Senate votes unless reconciliation applies.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The $1.9 trillion American Rescue Plan was passed using reconciliation.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The worst outcome will not occur if the House flips to Democratic control.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Democrats will no longer be able to use reconciliation to pass legislation with only their own votes.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "An additional $750 billion was added to federal spending last summer.",
